- `features: ["Communities"]` — enables Digital Experiences capability in the scratch org.
- `communitiesSettings.enableNetworksEnabled: true` — turns on Experience Cloud itself so `Network`/`ExperienceBundle` metadata can deploy.
- `experienceBundleSettings.enableExperienceBundleMetadata: true` — lets Aura sites deploy/retrieve as `ExperienceBundle` source (matches the repo's format) instead of the legacy bundle format.
